Package: GenomicPalindromesR
Title: Dot-Bracket Guided Palindrome Discovery in Mouse Genomes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Sana Wajid",
           family = "Author",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sanawgs@gmail.com")
Description: Scans DNA sequences and BSgenome mouse assemblies for inverted-repeat
    palindromes by translating candidate windows into RNA-style dot-bracket
    structural strings and then using tidyverse-friendly pattern matching to
    rank, filter, and summarize structural hits.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
